{{ name }} at {{ ip }} — tail its log file with the SIEMBOX log-shipper

Run the log-shipper agent somewhere with filesystem access to {{ name }}'s log
(directly on {{ ip }}, or on whatever host mounts its volume), then add this
source to its config.yml:

files:
  - path: "{{ log_path }}"
    tag: "{{ id }}"
    facility: local0

The shipper needs its own API key -- create one from the Shippers page if you
don't already have one running here -- and it forwards each new line as
syslog to {{ siembox_host }}:{{ siembox_port }} on its own, no restart of
SIEMBOX required.
